//RS //! TIR carrier for checked table-plan facts.
//RS //!
//RS //! This is a total, backend-neutral copy of the sema plan.  It intentionally
//RS //! has no evaluator, closure, row buffer, or target-specific operator.  A
//RS //! future MIR boundary can attach this value to a typed expression and every
//RS //! tier can consume the same decisions.
